WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.540
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.320
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.960
After deciding to enter the Academy's Special Audition,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.820
Aoi, Ran, and I are training first thing in the morning.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.060
Goal!

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.640
Ichigo's fast! She's incredible.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.620
That's true, but so's the amount of pain she looks like she's in.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.920
A-Are you okay?

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.340
I'm fine...

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.600
You don't look fine at all.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.540
If you're fine, you can still run, right? Five more laps!

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.680
I guess that's why we call you the Demon Coach.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.380
I told you, I'm not a demon. Not yet, at least.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.400
It's a Special Audition!

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.400
We won't get by with the usual practice.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.640
That might be true.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.940
I see.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.120
The Special Audition is an audition that's special.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.140
Right, special.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.580
By the way Ichigo, do you know what a Special Audition is?

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.120
Not at all!

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:15.460
Hi, signalize!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:20.800
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:20.800
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.690
No, that's wrong

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.690
iie chigau yo

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:28.070
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:28.070
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:29.860
Do that signalize!

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:35.040
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:35.040
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:39.000
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:39.000
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:42.540
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:42.540
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:47.710
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:47.710
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.050
Chance for me

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:54.350
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:54.350
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:58.560
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:58.560
hora chousen matteru yo

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:03.480
Where are we headed?

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:03.480
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:07.230
Into a brilliant hope

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:07.230
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:14.490
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:14.490
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.870
Where we're headed

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.870
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:21.750
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:21.750
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:29.090
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:29.090
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.660
The Special Audition is an audition held by the academy on a regular basis

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.420
to assess the students' progress.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.000
You'll receive a Mastery if you pass.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.020
A Mastery?

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:49.280
A Mastery is the proof of your growth as an idol.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.480
All of our predecessors received them too.

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:54.360
Mizuki-chan too?

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.100
Of course!

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.580
Got it. I've gotta give it my all!

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.340
You were doing that up till now too, you know.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:03.360
I'm amazed you could do all that without even knowing what a Special Audition was.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:05.240
But I was so happy!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.220
I was glad the three of us could stand on the same stage together.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.600
I'm happy too!

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.780
It's our first concert together. Let's sync our hearts and do this!

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:14.600
You too, Ran.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.360
Wh-Why now...

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.940
Let's all shout together.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.120
I don't want to. Besides, look at this.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:24.640
In order to pass the Special Audition, we'll all have to have Premium Dress cards.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.320
Premium Dress cards?

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.120
They're premium rare cards.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:32.160
Guess I'll have to ask for <i>his</i> help if I want to get some.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.650
"His"?

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:37.100
Premium!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.900
He ran out of breath...

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.460
They're worth the breath.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.660
Because Premium Cards are premiere!

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.640
I don't understand...

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:46.980
...what he's saying.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:49.920
So, just what are Premium Rare cards?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.780
No!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.160
We still haven't learned about them in class.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.400
Then I shall teach you.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.140
For I myself am rare.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:00.940
He said it himself.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:06.780
I'm sure you know that there are many different brands of Aikatsu cards.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.000
Right.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:11.000
My battle clothes are Spicy Ageha.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.080
That's right. And the brand I like is Angely Sugar.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.460
Futuring Girl is for me.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.700
Yeah, they suit you well.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.320
Each brand's top designer

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.080
puts their heart and soul into making the greatest outfit.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:28.460
Those are what we call Premium Rare cards.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:34.300
However, the only idols who can use them are those who have been approved by the top designer themself.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.060
Thusly, they are premiere.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.800
We've come to ask about that.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.100
Please let us meet those top designers.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.420
Hmm, that's rather difficult.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.400
But!

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.120
I'll make sure to set you girls up with appointments with them!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.180
Really?

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.620
Thank you!

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:52.940
Who do you think I am?

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.280
I'm Johnny!

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:56.020
Johnny Bepp!

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:59.080
I'm begging you, Headmistress Orihime.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:01.940
Do you think you could allow them to have meetings?

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.760
Hoshimiya, Kiriya, and Shibuki, huh.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.820
The time is certainly right.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.480
Alright, leave it to me.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.980
Thank you very much!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:16.680
Before you go on, tell me, did you tell those girls "I'll set you up" again?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:22.260
He said that he'll tell us when we'll be able to meet with the top designers,

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.160
so for now all we can do is wait.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.720
Ah, there's something that we need to decide now.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.620
What is it?

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:32.200
We need to decide on what song we'll perform for the Special Audition.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:32.940
Right?

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.120
Yeah.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.700
Huh? We get to choose?

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:40.140
You're allowed to pick what you perform during Special Auditions.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.880
If that's the case, then I've got something I want to sing.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:43.640
What is it?

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.640
Mizuki-chan's song!

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:49.860
You mean "Move on now!"?

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:50.660
Yeah!

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:54.620
I've been listening to it so much recently that my Aikatsu Phone's battery is about to die.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.960
After I heard that song, I started to admire Mizuki-chan

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.120
and first wanted to become an idol.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.600
That's why I want to sing it!

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:05.040
If we hadn't gone to that concert, we wouldn't be here together right now.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:06.540
I want to sing it too!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.020
How about you, Ran?

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:09.880
Sure, I like it too.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.680
Yay! Thanks!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.360
S-Stop it!

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:16.260
Let's train! Now that we've picked a song we'll train.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.060
I'll do anything for it.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.180
Me too.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.200
You said it.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.620
Prepare yourselves.

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.040
From this point on I'll become a true demon.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.400
N-Not just a Demon Coach...

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.680
But a Demon?

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.660
Alright! Let's sync our hearts and do this!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:42.800
Ran!

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:44.640
I said I don't want to do it.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:45.940
Why not?

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.440
It's embarrassing...

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:50.820
Got it. Then for starters, try calling my name.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:51.300
What?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:54.020
Come to think of it, she really hasn't called you that yet.

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:56.680
Right? Now try calling me Ichigo.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.840
Ichi... Ichi...

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:00.320
One, two, three!

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.310
Well, that coolness <i>is</i> her selling point.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.640
Come on, you two join me.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.320
Okay!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.960
Move on now! Move on now!

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:11.700
Isn't "One, two, three" better?

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:14.980
By the way, what does "Move on now" mean?

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.600
You were saying it without knowing the meaning, huh.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.100
"Now is the time to advance!"

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.000
It fits us perfectly.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:22.920
Hurry up and follow me.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.000
Move on now!

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:34.020
And finally, it's the day before the audition.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.080
We were really synchronized just now.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:47.520
Yeah!

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.500
It wouldn't be good if we hurt ourselves practicing too much.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:54.660
The audition's tomorrow, so let's go do something else for today.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.340
Then why don't we go to the library?

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:57.640
Let's study up on different brands.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:58.260
Sure!

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:01.220
But really, I wonder if we'll be able to meet the designers?

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.420
There's only one day left so it might not be possible.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.250
Sensei really seemed troubled back there.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.740
<i>Wait! Just give me a little more time.</i>

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.760
Wow, amazing!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.020
It's the most amazing of all amazing things!

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:16.300
I didn't know there were this many reference books.

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:18.860
Ah! They're...

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.580
Tachibana Michelle-chan and Himuro Asami-chan.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:22.380
Yeah.

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:25.400
Half-foreign Michelle-chan and quiet Asami-chan.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:29.620
Even though they're exact opposites they pair as a unit and work together.

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:31.400
That gap is their best point.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.480
Yahoo, Ran! 'Sup?

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.000
Hey.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.220
You know each other?

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.180
It's pretty rare to see you in the library.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:42.280
It's because these two wanted to study up on brands before our Special Audition.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:44.260
Really? We're entering it too!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:47.280
Um, if you're looking for brand reference materials...

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:51.380
Yeah, we messed up and accidentally printed too much.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.560
Please take these.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:53.760
Thanks.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.040
Thank you!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.700
Don't worry about it. Let's all do our best!

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:58.420
Well then.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:00.080
See you!

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.980
They're as nice as I heard about!

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.060
There you are. Kiriya, Shibuki.

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.660
We heard back from the top designers.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:09.600
If you leave now they can squeeze you into their schedules.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:10.360
Hurry up!

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.400
Yes!

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.060
Um, what about Ichigo?

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.000
We haven't heard back yet, sorry.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.080
Let's move forward with Kiriya and Shibuki for now.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.460
Ichigo...

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:23.460
Don't worry, go on ahead. I'll be waiting for you.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.720
Okay.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:29.700
Angely Sugar was established 180 years ago.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.100
That's a long history... huh?

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:36.080
This is a map of where the designer lives.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.860
Ichigo... Ichigo!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:00.420
Aoi, Ran. Welcome back.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:01.800
How'd it go?

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.360
Wow, they're sparkling!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:09.040
Yeah! The designer of Futuring Girl was a really nice person.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.600
She said that she's been watching all of my auditions

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:13.180
and that she'll let me wear these.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.600
That's great, Aoi!

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:15.380
Thanks!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:18.140
I always wear Spicy Ageha,

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:21.320
so she said that she was happy I came to see her.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.740
Awesome!

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.780
They've been watching the two of you all this time.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.840
Hey, geez...

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:30.640
All that's left are your Premium cards.

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:32.360
Yeah...

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.640
And so, even though I still hadn't gotten my Premium cards,

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:38.800
the day of the Special Audition arrived.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:43.720
If you aren't going to have your 
Premium cards, then we won't use ours.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:46.040
We got them to use together after all.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.060
That's right...

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:50.140
Alright, we'll practice as long as we can.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:03.900
Starmiya!

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.540
No, Hoshimiya.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:09.080
We finally heard from the top designer of Angely Sugar.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.820
You'll be able to meet her now.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:11.680
Right now?

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:12.640
Yeah.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:15.140
But if she can't make it back in time,

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:18.080
Hoshimiya won't be able to take the audition.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:22.100
It's too bad, but I think it would be safer to try to meet with the designer some other time.

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:24.900
Don't push your luck. 
We'll do it with regular coords.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.760
That's right, Ichigo.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:29.140
No, I'm going.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:33.320
It's a bit far away, but if I go all out I think I can make it.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:34.820
You shouldn't chance that!

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:38.780
But you two've already got your cards after working so hard.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:41.520
I need to get mine so we can use them together!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.060
Hold it, Hoshimiya!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.920
If you're going to go, then I'll drive you there.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.200
This place is kind of amazing.

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:54.720
Yeah, Angely Sugar has always been out here.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.160
You'll have to walk from here. If no—

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.660
Thank you very much!

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:05.620
Ah, hey!

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:09.000
It's this way.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.700
Huh?

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.620
Oh no! My map...

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:16.940
That's right!

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.660
I've still got the map from Michelle-chan!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.900
Hm... this way.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.020
Hey, so where <i>is</i> Angely Sugar anyway?

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.000
I'll check the site.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.640
It's on Angely Mountain.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:37.160
Mountain... like, with cliffs?!

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:40.640
Is it this way?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.480
It's a cliff!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.240
No way you'd have to climb up yourself, right?

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:53.260
No. Even though the designer lives at the very top, there's supposedly a high speed elevator.

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.520
Yeah, of course.

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.100
Move on now!

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.640
Now is the time I need to advance!

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.000
I hope she's not trying to climb up there.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.060
<i>The person you are calling is unable to answer their phone.</i>

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.980
She's not answering, it went straight to the machine.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.560
Kiriya, Shibuki.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:17.920
Where's Hoshimiya?

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.020
Well, she hasn't been able to come yet...

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.700
The time is absolute.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.520
If she can't make it, then you two will perform by yourselves.

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:30.660
Here we go!

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:31.900
Made it...

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:35.120
Y-Young lady, don't tell me you climbed up here?

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:35.700
Right!

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.060
Ah, could you be the top designer?

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:42.060
However you look at me there's no way...

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:44.920
My, you went up that cliff?!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.620
You really climbed up here?

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.140
Yes! I followed this map here.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.880
My, this is a map from ages past!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:53.660
Huh?

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:55.740
We have an elevator now.

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.800
What?!

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:00.300
It's been a while since someone's climbed up.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:02.060
Um, so are you...

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:06.160
Yes. I'm the top designer of Angely Sugar,

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.060
Amahane Asuka.

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:11.080
Sorry I haven't found the time for you until now.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.940
My name is Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:19.320
I love Angely Sugar, and came to ask if you would allow me to wear a Premium Dress.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.080
Follow me.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:34.140
All of Angely Sugar's outfits are made in here.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:39.120
I make them while hoping that they'll be able to give an angelic power to you girls.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.800
They're all so cute!

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.180
Thank you.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:46.840
But you know, I believe that angels don't appear to just anyone.

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:53.220
I'm sure that they only appear for those who try their best to shine.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:58.160
I want the outfits I create to be worn by those who put their hearts into what they do.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:00.260
They're perfect for you.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:01.120
Huh?

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:05.100
You are an idol worthy of Angely Sugar.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.100
Why?

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:09.440
To be frank, you could've died climbing that cliff.

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:12.680
And this is surely the work of fate.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.500
I have a new work that would fit you perfectly.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.340
Aurora Kiss coord.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:22.600
Ballet shoes, drape skirt, and a camisole and ribbon.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:26.280
I'll make them cards now.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:37.620
Thanks for coming out here.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.740
I'm sure these will fit you well!

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.160
Thank you very much.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:45.640
Now go on. It's almost time for your audition, right?

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.840
Go give it your best.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.660
Thank you very much!

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.000
Starmiya!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.980
Thirty minutes left.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.060
Only ten now.

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:13.380
Ah, that felt great!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:15.480
It's almost time for you as well.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:16.740
Yeah...

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:23.460
One minute left.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.600
Ichigo, thank goodness!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.860
Geez, we were about to go without you.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.020
Thanks for waiting for me.

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.740
I wanted to practice our dance more, but lets go.

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:38.840
We'll surely be fine.

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:44.620
You two believed in me and waited until the last minute.

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:47.100
If we believe in each other, we'll be fine.

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.300
Yeah!

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.620
We went through all that training too.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:53.600
Ran!

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:54.660
Did you know?

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:58.060
Idols make a personal chant for this sort of time.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:58.980
A chant?

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:00.870
You—Ichigo, decide on it.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.620
You just called me Ichigo!

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.120
Get on with it.

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:08.380
Then the chant for the three of us will be...

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.120
One, two—

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:14.600
Reach for tomorrow, Move on now!

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:09.240
Well? That was your song.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:13.780
All of you have passed!

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:16.700
Yay!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:17.460
We did it!

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:18.140
Yeah!

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:21.500
It might've been thanks to you calling my name!

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:22.300
That's just a coincidence.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.060
The Mastery of Song!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:45.040
How can the two of them fall asleep?

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:47.860
I'm so happy I can't sleep.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.080
I saw your audition.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:53.360
Mizuki-san!

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.640
"Move on now!" is my song.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:59.580
But at that moment, it belonged to all of you.

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:03.360
But the path ahead is long.

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:05.900
The Mastery is the proof of reaching the start line.

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.380
There are still five left.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:09.960
Do your best.

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.340
Good night.

00:22:11.340 --> 00:22:13.620
H-Have a good night!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:22.160
<i>Mizuki-san is still so far away.</i>

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.840
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:01.720
It seems they call going up a cliff "rock climbing".

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:03.480
There are also world competitions!

00:24:03.480 --> 00:24:04.900
I wonder if I can enter those too?

00:24:04.900 --> 00:24:07.640
First you'll have to conquer the world of idols!

00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:08.420
Yeah!

00:24:08.420 --> 00:24:10.000
Move on now!

00:24:10.980 --> 00:24:13.280
Who's that girl in the fountain?

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:15.520
Ah, it's Arisugawa Otome-chan!

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:18.180
Bingo! Love you!

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:19.240
She's strong!

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:20.620
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.620 --> 00:24:22.300
The Rainbow Maiden.

00:24:22.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
